/// game/components/
///
/// This folder will hold all Flame Component subclasses:
///   • PlayerComponent   — the jumping blue rectangle (Phase 2)
///   • PlatformComponent — the green rectangle the player lands on (Phase 3)
///   • BossComponent     — the red rectangle boss (Phase 6)
///   • ProjectileComponent — yellow circle attack (Phase 6)
///
/// Each component is self-contained: it owns its own rendering and update
/// logic and communicates with the game only through events or shared state.
